## Summary

- Auto mode enhances matching elements and generates the rest.
- Matching is by `id` attribute, scoped to the root.
- Authored fields stay in place; generated fields go into a container appended to the root.
- Excluded fields are neither enhanced nor generated, regardless of markup.
- The component code is the same as empty-root auto mode; only the HTML differs.



